---
import Container from '../primitives/Container.astro';
---
<section class="transition-statement"><Container><h2>Complex systems.<br />Thoughtful products.</h2><p>The interface is only the part people see. Behind it are decisions about data, state, architecture, product behavior, failure, and everything that has to work together.</p></Container></section>
<style>
  .transition-statement { padding-block:clamp(6rem,14vw,13rem); border-top:1px solid var(--color-border); }.transition-statement :global(.container) { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(12,1fr); gap:1rem; }.transition-statement h2 { grid-column:1 / span 8; font-size:clamp(3.5rem,7vw,7rem); line-height:.9; letter-spacing:-.07em; }.transition-statement p { grid-column:9 / span 4; align-self:end; color:var(--color-muted); font-size:1.1rem; }
  @media (max-width:640px) { .transition-statement :global(.container) { display:block; }.transition-statement p { margin-top:2rem; } }
</style>
